{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/15779/", "pk": 15779, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/", "pk": 4476, "shortname": "baycitybike", "name": "Bay City Bike", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Alcatraz & Streets of San Francisco Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Alcatraz & Streets of San Francisco Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Call for Availability", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 480, "description": "***Alcatraz tour on your booked date; Bike tour the next day at 11:00 AM!***\n\n###Duration\n\nAlcatraz Tour 2 to 3 hours \nBike Tour 3 to 4 hours (Next day at 11 AM)\n\n***This tour is for age 13 & up***\nBeginner to Novice\n_______________________\n\n###Activity details\n\nExperience two of San Francisco’s most iconic adventures with this 2-day Alcatraz and citywide e-bike tour package. \n\nOn your selected booking date, head to Pier 33 to board the ferry to Alcatraz Island, where you’ll explore the former federal penitentiary with the award-winning audio tour. Wander through historic cell blocks, learn about infamous inmates like Al Capone, and take in panoramic views of the Bay before returning to the city.\n\nThe following day, meet your guide for a 15-mile electric bike tour through San Francisco’s most vibrant neighborhoods. Ride an energy-saving e-bike that makes hills easy as you explore North Beach, cruise along the waterfront to the Ferry Building, and pass Oracle Park and the Design District. Stop for a break at a local food-truck park before continuing into La Mission to admire colorful murals and rich cultural history.\n\nPedal through the iconic Castro District, home to Harvey Milk Plaza, and continue through the Wiggle into the legendary Haight-Ashbury area, birthplace of the Summer of Love. Finish the tour with a ride down Polk Street, an ever-evolving neighborhood layered with history, before returning to Fisherman’s Wharf. Guests may keep their e-bike until closing time or return it after the tour.\n\n\n***Alcatraz Info***\nAlcatraz departure time will be sent approximately 3 days before your tour. \n\nBoats depart from Pier 33. Arrive a minimum of 30 minutes before your departure. All riders’ names must have been submitted with booking. Riders MUST present ID at tour time.\n\n***Bike Tour Info***\nCheck-in 30 minutes before the tour and meet your guide at ***2661 Taylor Street TOUR CENTER*** in Fisherman’s Wharf.\n\n###What's included\n\n* Official Alcatraz Island visit with award-winning audio tour\n* Round-trip ferry from Pier 33 included\n* 3-4 hour guided tour with an expert guide sharing fun facts and historical stories\n* Full-Day electric bike rental\n* Helmet, lock, and map", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Bring a copy of this voucher to redeem your tours!\n\n**Note, The day you book is the Alcatraz Tour**\n\n•  Alcatraz Tour starting time:  This will be sent to you 4 days prior to the reservation date; Typically it is a morning departure time.\n\n•  Bike Tour starting time: 11am. Bike Tour is the day after Alcatraz. This will be reiterated in confirmation sent to you 4 days prior.\n\n•  We take a monetary authorization on all rentals, starting at $500 per Ebike. The authorized amount is held until we have the safe return of all rental equipment.", "cancellation_notes": "#All Alcatraz packages are non-refundable once booked. \n**Cancellation and No-Show Policy:** \n\n• Cancellations and no-shows for Alcatraz Packages are non-refundable. Reservation no shows are charged in full.\n\n**Changed Reservation Dates Policy:** \n\n• Alcatraz trips cannot be modified in anyway. Bike Tour date and times may be re-scheduled as desired by contacting the Reservation desk but are non-refundable.\n\n**Reservation Terms & Conditions**\n\n• FOR ALCATRAZ: Please arrive at Pier 33, Alcatraz Landing, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Failure to do so may result in the cancellation of your trip. Bring ID\n• FOR BIKE TOUR: Please arrive at 2661 Taylor St, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Bring Credit Card and ID.\n• It is not transferable, has no cash value, and may be redeemed only once.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2-Day Alcatraz Ticket + San Francisco E-Bike Tour", "short_description": "2 Days: Alcatraz Ticket + San Francisco Guided E-Bike Tour", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/JZVRvsPUSbyzFiketr6c", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/JZVRvsPUSbyzFiketr6c", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/15779/images/1767944/", "pk": 1767944, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1QxtclU7TtiEqeV7KWoh", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1QxtclU7TtiEqeV7KWoh", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/15779/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1QxtclU7TtiEqeV7KWoh", "cr